  "prefLabel": "Plc 2004.04 Documentation Requirements; Audits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2004.04 Documentation Requirements; Audits.\n\n(a) Certificants shall comply with the continuing education recordkeeping requirements in, and shall be subject to the audit provisions of Plc 308.04.\n\n(b) When applying to renew a certification, the applicant shall:\n\n(1) Identify each program used to meet the continuing education requirement by name of sponsor, date and length of program, program instructor, and program location; and\n\n(2) Sign an attestation on the renewal application that the applicable continuing education requirements have been met.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
